      "arabic": "١٠٧٧٧- أبرهة الحبشية:\nمن خدم النجاشي.\nكانت عند أم حبيبة لما زوجها النجاشي للنّبيّ ﷺ.",
      "english": "10777—Abraha the Abyssinian:\n\nOne of the attendants of the Negus. She was with Umm Habiba when the Negus gave Umm Habiba in marriage to the Prophet, may Allah bless him and grant him peace.",
